      "reasoning": "I'm on the play with a decent hand. I have a mix of lands and impactful spells, including multiple cards that benefit from or interact with Shrines and tokens. While I don't have a 1-drop, I do have Fire Lord Zuko as a turn-1 play, which can help generate mana for future turns via firebending when it attacks.\n\
\n\
